# Haxe reference in-source test runner (docs/specs/features/19-testing.md).
-cp src
-cp samples
-cp out/haxe
--macro Intercept.run(['samples'], ['samples/boring/BinaryReader.hx', 'samples/boring/BinaryWriter.hx', 'samples/boring/Fp32.hx'])
-main TestMain
-js out/haxe/test-main.js
-D analyzer-optimize
-D boring_oracle
